@startuml
title Lifecycle of a pending request

[*] --> CREATED
CREATED --> QUEUED
QUEUED --> SENT
SENT --> TRANSPORT_ERROR : write fails
SENT --> WAITING
WAITING --> TIMEOUT : deadline expires
WAITING --> COMPLETED : response arrives
TIMEOUT --> LATE_RESPONSE : response arrives anyway
COMPLETED --> [*] : result or error
TRANSPORT_ERROR --> [*]
LATE_RESPONSE --> [*] : discarded, id no longer pending
@enduml
